---
import SectionHeading from '../SectionHeading.astro';
import MotionDemos from '../motion/MotionDemos';
import { MOTION_TOKENS } from '../type/tokenSources';

const reducedTokens = MOTION_TOKENS.overrides['(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)'] ?? {};
---

<section id="motion" class="scroll-mt-28 py-16">
  <SectionHeading
    eyebrow="Motion"
    title="Motion"
    lead="The easing curves, springs and durations from Propellant's motion tokens. Press Play to run each one, and again to send it back."
  />
  <MotionDemos client:visible tokens={MOTION_TOKENS.base} reducedTokens={reducedTokens} />
  <p
    class="m-0 mt-4 max-w-[68ch] text-[length:var(--type-callout-size)] leading-[var(--type-callout-line)] text-[var(--label-secondary)]"
  >
    When a device asks for reduced motion, the tokens shorten the three springs and the exit
    duration to 1ms, so things land in place without moving. The instant and fade durations stay
    as they are. Use the tokens and you get this for free.
  </p>
</section>
